  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/958291/description_31da0c1a-3425-4a56-b9ff-8795113b90fd.png\" alt=\"Crate Delight\"></p><p><strong>使用板條箱與袋子擴展你的儲物空間，整理你的物品！</strong> Crate Delight 讓你能夠製作板條箱與袋子，以時尚的方式整理資源，保持你的儲物箱整潔，並讓背包井然有序。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crate-delight-fabric/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=26.1&amp;showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下載 26.1 更新\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crate-delight-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9HxDzV.png\" alt=\"Fabric 下載\"></a></p><h2>🍎 特色</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>板條箱：</strong>可存放蘋果、甜莓、雞蛋、生鮭魚、生鱈魚、螢光莓、金蘋果等多種物品！</li>\n<li><strong>袋子：</strong>用於存放可可豆、糖、火藥等物品。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>🛠️ 附加模組</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcrate-delight-croptopia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crate Delight: Croptopia</a>&nbsp;\n<ul>\n<li>為 Croptopia 新增超過 50 種新的板條箱與袋子。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"為筆記型電腦募款中！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我按鈕\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐款按鈕\"></a></p>",
